 "T":{"kind":"relation","from":"t","alias":"t","fields":{"TID":{"column":"tid","type":"NUM"},"TV":{"column":"tv","type":"NUM"}}},
 "U":{"kind":"relation","from":"u","alias":"u","fields":{"ID":{"column":"id","type":"NUM"},"UV":{"column":"uv","type":"NUM"}}}}
--- as
statement
--- source
R .> LINK(S, X, Y, X["X"]["id"] == Y["y"]["id"]) .> MAP(RECORD("v", _["X"]["x"]["rv"]))
--- expect
SELECT "r"."rv" AS "v" FROM "r" "r" INNER JOIN "s" "s" ON (CAST("r"."id" AS NUMERIC) = CAST("s"."id" AS NUMERIC))
===

### name: link.qualifier.no-join
--- note
A relation's row is a plain record: it has no key named after the relation.
--- dialect
sqlite
--- bindings
{"R":{"kind":"relation","from":"r","alias":"r","fields":{"ID":{"column":"id","type":"NUM"},"RV":{"column":"rv","type":"NUM"}}},
 "S":{"kind":"relation","from":"s","alias":"s","fields":{"ID":{"column":"id","type":"NUM"},"SV":{"column":"sv","type":"NUM"}}},
 "T":{"kind":"relation","from":"t","alias":"t","fields":{"TID":{"column":"tid","type":"NUM"},"TV":{"column":"tv","type":"NUM"}}},
 "U":{"kind":"relation","from":"u","alias":"u","fields":{"ID":{"column":"id","type":"NUM"},"UV":{"column":"uv","type":"NUM"}}}}
--- as
statement
--- source
R .> MAP(RECORD("v", _["R"]["rv"]))
--- error
E_SQL_SHAPE 1:23
===

### name: link.qualifier.alias
--- note
A SQL alias is not a SEL name: the joined row has no key `ra`.
--- dialect
sqlite
--- bindings
{"R":{"kind":"relation","from":"rtab","alias":"ra","fields":{"ID":{"column":"id","type":"NUM"},"RV":{"column":"rv","type":"NUM"}}},
 "S":{"kind":"relation","from":"stab","alias":"sa","fields":{"ID":{"column":"id","type":"NUM"},"SV":{"column":"sv","type":"NUM"}}}}
--- as
statement
--- source
R .> LINK(S, _1["id"] == _2["id"]) .> MAP(RECORD("v", _["ra"]["rv"]))
--- error
E_SQL_SHAPE 1:56
===

### name: link.qualifier.table
