 "S":{"kind":"relation","from":"stab","alias":"sa","fields":{"ID":{"column":"id","type":"NUM"},"SV":{"column":"sv","type":"NUM"}}}}
--- as
statement
--- source
R .> LINK(S, _1["id"] == _2["id"]) .> MAP(RECORD("v", _["rtab"]["rv"]))
--- error
E_SQL_SHAPE 1:56
===

