--- expect
SELECT "_2"."v" AS "n" FROM "plain" INNER JOIN "plain" "_2" ON (CAST("plain"."id" AS NUMERIC) = CAST("_2"."id" AS NUMERIC))
===

### name: link.order.an-earlier-sort-key-refuses-before-the-join
--- note
Review 2026-09-28 SQL-10, from the widened SQL fuzzer. The first TOP_BY
reads a field CUSTOMERS lacks, which run() reaches first; JS, PHP, Python
and C++ reported the derived table over the join instead, which Lisp had
stopped doing in review 2026-09-25 SQL-03.
--- dialect
sqlite
--- bindings
{"ORDERS":{"kind":"relation","from":"orders","alias":"o","fields":{"ID":{"table":"o","column":"id","type":"NUM"},"CUSTOMER_ID":{"table":"o","column":"customer_id","type":"NUM"},"NAME":{"table":"o","column":"name","type":"TEXT"}}},"CUSTOMERS":{"kind":"relation","from":"customers","alias":"c","fields":{"ID":{"table":"c","column":"id","type":"NUM"},"NAME":{"table":"c","column":"name","type":"TEXT"}}},"PLAIN":{"kind":"relation","from":"plain","fields":{"ID":{"column":"id","type":"NUM"},
 "V":{"column":"v","type":"NUM"}}}}
--- as
statement
--- source
CUSTOMERS .> TOP_BY(_["QTY"], 1) .> LINK(CUSTOMERS, O, C, O["id"] == C["id"]) .> TOP_BY(_["name"], 1)
--- error
E_SQL_BINDING 1:22
===

### name: link.order.an-earlier-bucket-key-refuses-before-the-join
--- note
The bucket key is the whole row, refused where it is written, not at the
FILTER three steps on.
--- dialect
sqlite
--- bindings
{"ORDERS":{"kind":"relation","from":"orders","alias":"o","fields":{"ID":{"table":"o","column":"id","type":"NUM"},"CUSTOMER_ID":{"table":"o","column":"customer_id","type":"NUM"},"NAME":{"table":"o","column":"name","type":"TEXT"}}},"CUSTOMERS":{"kind":"relation","from":"customers","alias":"c","fields":{"ID":{"table":"c","column":"id","type":"NUM"},"NAME":{"table":"c","column":"name","type":"TEXT"}}},"PLAIN":{"kind":"relation","from":"plain","fields":{"ID":{"column":"id","type":"NUM"},
 "V":{"column":"v","type":"NUM"}}}}
--- as
statement
--- source
ORDERS .> BUCKET(_) .> LINK(CUSTOMERS, _1["id"] == _2["id"]) .> SELECT_COLS("name") .> FILTER(_["ID"] == 0)
--- error
E_SQL_SHAPE 1:18
===

